Conflicts: signal-l5
Replaces: signal-l5
Description: Signal messenger for the Librem 5 (unofficial)
 A native GTK/libadwaita Signal client that runs as the primary Signal
 device: register your phone number on the phone itself with SMS
 verification. Signal's captcha can be solved on a computer or another
 phone on the same Wi-Fi and is handed to the phone automatically.
 .
 Supports one-to-one and group chats with attachments, replies, reactions,
 delete for everyone, read receipts, typing indicators, voice calls,
 phone-contact lookup and notifications while the app is closed.
 .
 Bundles signal-cli 0.14.8, its aarch64 libsignal native library, a Java 25
 runtime (Eclipse Temurin) and signal-call-tunnel (RingRTC) for calls.
